<p>Hits the target with a mighty blow to the legs doing <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">117%, 125%, 130%, 135%, 140%</acronym> weapon damage. If the attack hits, the target is unable to move for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3, 4, 5, 6, 7</acronym> turns.</p>